  <!-- ── Surprise gifting ───────────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>CAN YOU KEEP IT A SURPRISE</pattern>
    <template>Entirely. You supply all the details about the person being celebrated, and we craft the song around what you share — the recipient has no idea it's coming until you present it. It's one of the most intimate surprises you can give.
    </template>
  </category>

