  <!-- ── Secret/surprise gifting process ───────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW DO I ORDER A GIFT WITHOUT THEM KNOWING</pattern>
    <template>Everything is handled through you — the person you're gifting never needs to be involved. You share what we need to know about them in the inquiry form, we collaborate entirely with you, and you present the finished song however you choose when the moment is right. Nothing in our process reaches them unless you decide to share it.
      <nav-card label="Commission a Gift Song" href="/contact"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW DO I KEEP THE COMMISSION PRIVATE</pattern>
    <template><srai>HOW DO I ORDER A GIFT WITHOUT THEM KNOWING</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT IF THEY FIND OUT IT IS A SURPRISE</pattern>
    <template>Once the song is delivered to you, it belongs to the moment you choose for it — and that moment is entirely within your control. We don't communicate with the recipient at any point, and nothing about the commission appears anywhere except in your inbox. The surprise is yours to protect.
    </template>
  </category>

  <!-- ── Gift presentation ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW DO I PRESENT THE SONG AS A GIFT</pattern>
    <template>The song arrives as a downloadable audio file, which gives you complete flexibility in how you share it. Many clients play it at a dinner or gathering; some send it as a private link with a handwritten note; others print the lyrics alongside it. The moment you choose to reveal it is what makes it unforgettable — the song does the rest.
    </template>
  </category>

