  <category>
    <pattern>CAN YOU HELP ME WRITE THE BRIEF</pattern>
    <template>The brief doesn't need to be polished — just honest. Start with three things: who the song is for, the occasion, and one memory or feeling you want it to carry. The discovery call is where we ask the follow-up questions and fill in everything else together. You don't need it figured out before you reach out.
