  <!-- ── Timeline: how far in advance ────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW FAR IN ADVANCE SHOULD I ORDER</pattern>
    <template>For most occasions, ordering 4–6 weeks ahead gives comfortable room for our standard 2–4 week turnaround plus a round or two of revisions. For especially important dates — a wedding, a milestone anniversary, a retirement ceremony — we'd recommend reaching out as early as possible. Mention your date in the inquiry and we'll confirm availability.
      <nav-card label="Start Your Inquiry" href="/contact" description="Mention your date in the form"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHEN SHOULD I ORDER</pattern>
