  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT IS THE LATEST I CAN ORDER</pattern>
    <template>With our standard 2–4 week turnaround for a single track, submitting your inquiry at least four weeks before the occasion leaves room for revisions as well. If your date is closer than that, rush delivery options are available — mention your deadline in the inquiry and we'll confirm whether we can accommodate it.
      <nav-card label="Start Your Inquiry" href="/contact"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
