  </category>

  <!-- ── Gift recipient anxiety: will it be right for them ──────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW DO I KNOW THE SONG WILL BE RIGHT FOR THEM</pattern>
    <template>The more you share about the person — their taste, the artists they love, the memories that shaped your relationship — the more precisely we can tailor the song to resonate with them specifically. The discovery call draws all of that out. And if the first draft needs refinement, the three revision rounds give us the space to get it exactly right before the moment arrives.
      <quick-replies><reply>How many revisions do I get?</reply><reply>Can I provide a reference track?</reply></quick-replies>
    </template>
  </category>

