    <template>That's often the most meaningful response a gift can produce — and it's exactly what we aim for when the brief calls for it. A song written specifically around someone's story reaches people in ways that ordinary gifts simply can't. If that kind of emotional impact is what you're after, tell us what you want the moment to feel like and we'll write toward it.
      <nav-card label="Commission Your Song" href="/contact"/>
    </template>
